    "text": "Technical reference for the Phase 0 TerminusDB substrate implementation, canonical JSON-LD schema design, AST transduction pipelines, backup mechanisms, and cross-machine synchronization protocols.",
    "title": "00C64YWET0002",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
