    "blockId": "00C5FPA5PG00Q",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**Primary Adopted Method**: Creates a tarball of the backing Docker volume `terminusdb_storage` via a temporary Alpine container with the TerminusDB container temporarily stopped to ensure on-disk head consistency.",
    "title": "00C5FPA5PG00Q",
    "tombstonedAt": "2026-08-30T02:02:19.881Z",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
