  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18021",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA18021",
    "children": [],
    "text": "The inner human spirit achieving freedom through the liberation of the soul.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G00Q",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18022",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA18022",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18023",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18024"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G00R",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18023",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA18023",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Etymologically layered:",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G00S",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18024",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA18024",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18025",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18027",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18029"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX5G00T",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18025",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA18025",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18026"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G00V",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18026",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA18026",
    "children": [],
    "text": "*A-* (without) + *Peras* (limit) = **Unbound**: Not merely “unlimited” in size, but intrinsically free from rigid constraints.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G00W",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18027",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA18027",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18028"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G00X",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18028",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA18028",
    "children": [],
    "text": "*Aperas* in Esperanto = “Appears / Emerges”: The active manifestation where structured forms materialize out of the fluid core on demand.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G00Y",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18029",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA18029",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C64YWX5G010"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G00Z",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1802A",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Appam / Flatbread: The warm, versatile, round flatbread – simple, wholesome, and adaptable to any filling or shape.",
    "title": "00C5FPAA1802A",
    "tombstonedAt": "2026-08-30T02:02:21.722Z",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1802B",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802C"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G011",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1802C",
    "children": [],
    "text": "While daily interaction imposes limits and fixed roles, the liberated soul breaks through the illusion of rigid division, realizing its inner ground is identical in essence to the boundless Apeiron.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G012",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1802D",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802E",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802F"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G013",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1802E",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Peras – Bound (The Interface – Transient Boundary)",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G014",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802F",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1802F",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802G",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802J"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX5G015",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1802G",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802H"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G016",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802H",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1802H",
    "children": [],
    "text": "The limit, boundary, or transient interface where interaction occurs.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G017",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802J",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1802J",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802K"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G018",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802K",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1802K",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Form is not a rigid cage, but a temporary, playful instrument. Content remains formless (Apeiron), while the interface solidifies temporarily into defined structures (Peras) to accelerate interaction, then dissolves effortlessly back into the origin.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G019",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802M",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1802M",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802N",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802P"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G01A",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802N",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1802N",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Multi-Faceted Node Epistemology (The Wikipedia Reference Model)",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G01B",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1802P",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1802P",
    "children": [
