      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R002"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX5G01P",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18031",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA18031",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18032"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G01Q",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18032",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA18032",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Surface view (Article – Peras projection): Markdown and HTML outliner blocks rendered for human reading and fast LLM context window ingestion.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G01R",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18033",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA18033",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18034"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G01S",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA18034",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA18034",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Graph view (Source – Canonical triples): Semantic graph triples, explicit parent-child hierarchies, typed predicates (`impacts`, `verifies`, `derived_from`), and IRI references.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G01T",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R000",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R001"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G01V",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R001",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Discourse view (Talk – Agent trails): Agent trails, deliberations, conflicting perspectives, and reasoning traces behind decision states.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G01W",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R002",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R003"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G01X",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R003",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Provenance view (History – Audit deltas): Immutable commit logs, author signatures (human or agent ID), and atomic revision deltas.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G01Y",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R004",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R005",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R006"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G01Z",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R005",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Meta-Aperas / Self-Aperas (Recursive Methodology)",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G020",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R006",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R007"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX5G021",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R007",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R008",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R009"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G022",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R008",
    "children": [],
    "text": "System evolution as ontological practice",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G023",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R009",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00A",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00C",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00E",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00G"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX5G024",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R00A",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00B"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G025",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R00B",
    "children": [],
    "text": "The engineering roadmap of Aperas is itself a self-instantiation of its underlying philosophy.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G026",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R00C",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00D"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G027",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R00D",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Phase 0 begins in the uncarved, schema-free substrate (Apeiron), avoiding premature interfaces or heavy abstractions.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G028",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R00E",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00F"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G029",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00F",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R00F",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Projections, skills, and tools (Perata) crystallize organically on demand only as concrete human–agent coordination points emerge.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02A",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R00G",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00H"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02B",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00H",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R00H",
    "children": [],
    "text": "The platform builds itself using the exact principles it uses to manage knowledge: fluid at rest, bound and structured when touched.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02C",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00J",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R00J",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00K",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00M"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02D",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00K",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R00K",
    "children": [],
    "text": "System Architecture and Mechanics of Aperas",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02E",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA1R00M",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA1R00M",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20000",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000R",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001E",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001S",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002B"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02F",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20000",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20000",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20001",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20002"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02G",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20001",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20001",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Architectural Philosophy: Fluid Core vs. Crystallized Interfaces",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02H",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20002",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20002",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20003",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000A",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000H"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02J",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20003",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20003",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20004",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20005"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02K",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20004",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20004",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Fluid core substrate (Apeiron – formless content)",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02M",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20005",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20005",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20006",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20008"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02N",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20006",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20006",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20007"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02P",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20007",
    "children": [],
    "text": "The canonical state substrate remains a continuous, unconditioned semantic field – a rich graph of associations, atomic assertions, decisions, and raw evidence without rigid schema impedance.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02Q",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20008",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20009"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02R",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20009",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Avoids premature schema-on-write constraints that destroy nuance or cause friction during exploratory thought and multi-agent reasoning.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02S",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000A",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000B",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000C"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02T",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000B",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Schema-as-projection (Peras – crystallized interfaces)",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02V",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000C",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000D",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000F"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02W",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000D",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000E"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02X",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000E",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Schemas, types, enums, and unique identifiers are not intrinsic properties of the data substrate; they are temporary, disposable crystallizations generated on demand.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02Y",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000F",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000F",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000G"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G02Z",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000G",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Interfaces represent agreed-upon, lossy compressions between two parties (agents, APIs, UI engines) designed to minimize interaction friction and maximize transaction speed.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G030",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000H",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000H",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000J",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000K"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G031",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000J",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000J",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Perimeter boundary transducers",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G032",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000K",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000K",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000M",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000P"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX5G033",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000M",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000M",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000N"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G034",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000N",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000N",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Type systems (e.g., Pydantic in Python, Zod/TypeBox in TypeScript) live strictly at the system perimeter (boundary transducers) rather than polluting the core graph engine.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G035",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000P",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000P",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000Q"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G036",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000Q",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000Q",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Boundary agents sample the fluid core (Apeiron) and project it into rigid, type-safe structures (Peras) strictly when interacting with deterministic runtimes (databases, AST compilers, UI outliners, or structured LLM tool endpoints).",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G037",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000R",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000R",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000S",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000T"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G038",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000S",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000S",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Multi-Agent Projection Pattern",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G039",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000T",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000T",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000V",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20010",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20017"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX5G03A",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000V",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000V",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000W",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000X"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G03B",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000W",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000W",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Pattern definition",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G03C",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000X",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000X",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000Y"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX5G03D",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000Y",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000Y",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000Z"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G03E",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2000Z",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2000Z",
    "children": [],
    "text": "An architectural paradigm where a high-dimensional, fluid state graph (Apeiron) acts as the single source of truth, while specialized agents act as bidirectional transducers (lenses) mediating human and machine interactions.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5G03F",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20010",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20010",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20011",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20012"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5G03G",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20011",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20011",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Read-side projection lenses (deep read)",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R000",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20012",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20012",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20013",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20015"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX5R001",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20013",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20013",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20014"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R002",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20014",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20014",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Specialized projection agents extract subgraphs and crystallize them into low-dimensional, context-specific interfaces (Peras) like Markdown outliners, source code ASTs, or sequence diagrams.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R003",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20015",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20015",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20016"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R004",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20016",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20016",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Enables deep read capabilities where every rendered element retains provenance anchors and backlinks, allowing readers to drill down into the supporting evidence subgraph.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R005",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20017",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20017",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20018",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20019"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R006",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20018",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20018",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Write-side control and delta ingestion (deep write)",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R007",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20019",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20019",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001A",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001C"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX5R008",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2001A",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001B"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R009",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2001B",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Intake and impact agents parse view-level edits, calculate semantic diffs, and commit reified assertion nodes or validity updates back to the substrate.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R00A",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2001C",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001D"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R00B",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2001D",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Enables deep write capabilities where edits trigger impact traversals along `affects` or `constrains` edges, calculating downstream ripple effects and queuing advisory invalidations.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R00C",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2001E",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001F",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001G"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R00D",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001F",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2001F",
    "children": [],
    "text": "System Taxonomy and Vocabulary",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R00E",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
