  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001J",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2001J",
    "children": [],
    "text": "System / Platform: **Aperas** – The unbound environment where structure emerges (“appears”).",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R00H",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001K",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2001K",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001M"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R00J",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001M",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2001M",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Fluid Core Substrate: **Apeiron** (`aperas-apeiron` / `core`) – The unconditioned, schema-free continuum where thoughts and semantic links flow without artificial boundaries.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R00K",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001N",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2001N",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001P"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R00M",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001P",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2001P",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Boundary Projections / Interfaces: **Peras** (`aperas-peras` / `projections`) – The transient, typed structures (JSON Schema, Zod/Pydantic models, AST trees, DB mutations).",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R00N",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001Q",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2001Q",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001R"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R00P",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001R",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2001R",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Transduction Process: **Aperas** (*to appear / materialize*) – The active emergence of structured Peras out of the unconditioned Apeiron.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R00Q",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2001S",
