  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002F",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2002F",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Unconstrained reasoning to batch command emission",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R01E",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2002G",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002H",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002K"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX5R01F",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002H",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2002H",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002J"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R01G",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002J",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2002J",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Reasoner agents operate with free-flow, unconstrained thinking to analyze context and draft mutations without suffering from structured output reasoning constraints.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R01H",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002K",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2002K",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002M"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R01J",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002M",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2002M",
    "children": [],
    "text": "At turn termination, the agent emits a single batch tool call or tagged payload containing array-based command intents (e.g., `list[CommandIntent]`).",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R01K",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002N",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2002N",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002P",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002Q"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R01M",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002P",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2002P",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Event-driven async fan-out",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R01N",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002Q",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2002Q",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002R",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002T"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX5R01P",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002R",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2002R",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002S"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R01Q",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002S",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2002S",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Emitted command batches are pushed to an event-driven dispatcher and executed concurrently across worker coroutines and service endpoints.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R01R",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002T",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2002T",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002V"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R01S",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002V",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2002V",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Agents remain non-blocking and decoupled from slow, synchronous tool-calling loops.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R01T",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002W",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2002W",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002X",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002Y"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R01V",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002X",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2002X",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Self-healing boundary validation",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R01W",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002Y",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2002Y",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002Z"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX5R01X",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2002Z",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2002Z",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20030"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R01Y",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20030",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20030",
    "children": [],
    "text": "If a command payload violates boundary schema rules (Peras), type validation tracebacks are fed back to the boundary agent for immediate, localized repair without polluting the fluid core (Apeiron).",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R01Z",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20031",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20031",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20032",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20033"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R020",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20032",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20032",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Node, AST, and Storage Design in Aperas",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R021",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20033",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20033",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20034",
