  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20038",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20038",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Coarse by default, fine when touched",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R027",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20039",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20039",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2003A",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2003C",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2003E"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX5R028",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2003A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2003A",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2003B"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R029",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2003B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2003B",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Content is preserved at coarse granularity (full paragraph, list item, or document block) without forcing upfront micro-fragmentation into tokens or words.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R02A",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2003C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2003C",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2003D"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R02B",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2003D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2003D",
    "children": [],
    "text": "The moment a sub-clause, phrase, word, or punctuation mark is addressed, linked, commented on in the Talk view, or bound to a predicate, that specific slice crystallizes into an addressed node with its own identity (URI or UUID).",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R02C",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2003E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2003E",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2003F"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX5R02D",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2003F",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2003F",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Untouched surrounding text remains unfragmented text chunks.",
    "title": "00C64YWX5R02E",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2003G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2003G",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2003H",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2003J"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX60000",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2003H",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2003H",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Three parallel planes of architecture",
