    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2004V",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2004V",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Document level (`root` in mdast) corresponds to the page or section document container node.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6001D",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2004W",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2004W",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2004X"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6001E",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2004X",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2004X",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Block level (`listItem` / `paragraph` in mdast) corresponds to individual outliner blocks with parent-child graph edges.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6001F",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2004Y",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2004Y",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2004Z"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6001G",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2004Z",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2004Z",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Phrase or entity level (`link` / `span` in hast) corresponds to on-demand reified nodes for addressed inline spans.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6001H",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20050",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20050",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20051"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6001J",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20051",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20051",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Word or token level (`nlcst`) acts as ephemeral parser nodes used strictly during transduction passes, reified into graph nodes only when explicitly touched.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6001K",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20052",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20052",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20053",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20054"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6001M",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20053",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20053",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Offset tracking and synchronization",
    "title": "00C64YWX6001N",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20054",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20054",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20055",
