  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2005G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2005G",
    "children": [],
    "text": "The engineering roadmap is itself a self-instantiation of the Aperas ontology: starting in the unconditioned substrate (Apeiron) and crystallizing typed interfaces (Perata) on demand as human–agent coordination needs emerge.",
    "title": "00C64YWX60022",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
