  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006N",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2006N",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006P"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX60037",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006P",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2006P",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Develops specialized procedural skills including ingestion (parsing external text into AST nodes), graph search (structural traversals and WOQL/GraphQL pattern matching, with vector support evaluated later), and refactoring (lazy atomization of spans and node merging).",
    "title": "00C64YWX60038",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006Q",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2006Q",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006R",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006S"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX60039",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006R",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2006R",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Co-evolution of tools and perata",
    "title": "00C64YWX6003A",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006S",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2006S",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006T"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX6003B",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006T",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2006T",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006V"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6003C",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006V",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2006V",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Each new skill definition naturally introduces corresponding tooling and new **perata** (specialized view projections).",
    "title": "00C64YWX6003D",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006W",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2006W",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006X",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006Y"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6003E",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006X",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2006X",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Collaboration perata: review/merge-request workflow",
    "title": "00C64YWX6003F",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006Y",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2006Y",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006Z",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20071",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20073"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX6003G",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2006Z",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2006Z",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20070"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6003H",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20070",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20070",
    "children": [],
    "text": "TerminusDB's `rebase`/`apply` give branch reconciliation but no GitHub-style review layer — no proposal-with-discussion, approval state, or inline comment thread sits between \"diverged branches\" and \"merged.\"",
    "title": "00C64YWX6003J",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20071",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20071",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20072"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6003K",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20072",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20072",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Aperas extends the multi-faceted node model (Discourse view / Talk) to a first-class review document type: a proposal node wrapping a source/target branch pair, with discussion threads, review state, and conflict-resolution notes stored as subdocuments in the KG rather than in an external tool.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6003M",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20073",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20073",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20074"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6003N",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20074",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20074",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Keeps Aperas GitHub-like as well as Git-like: comments, issues, and review decisions become graph-native, queryable, and provenance-tracked alongside the commits they discuss, instead of living in a bolted-on external system.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6003P",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20075",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20075",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20076",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20077"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6003Q",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20076",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA20076",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Phase 3: Multi-agent specialization and Aperas Agent interfaces",
    "title": "00C64YWX6003R",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA20077",
