    "title": "00C64YWX60048",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28007",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28007",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28008"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX60049",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28008",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28008",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**Manual skill mode (procedural / CLI execution):** The coding agent executes raw procedural skills (`SKILL.md`) directly against the substrate, preserving full operational autonomy without API dependencies.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6004A",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28009",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28009",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2800A"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6004B",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2800A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2800A",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**Tool mode (active query):** Exposes high-level perata tools and service endpoints for the coding agent to interact directly with the Aperas Agent on demand.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6004C",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2800B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2800B",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2800C"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6004D",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2800C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2800C",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**Hook mode (automatic context engineering):** Injects perata and context projections directly into the context window of the coding agent via background events and triggers.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6004E",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2800D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2800D",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2800E",
