  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2800Q",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2800Q",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**TerminusDB** (chosen primary substrate) provides revision control on knowledge graphs with Git-like branches, delta layers, diffs, and merge requests.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6005P",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2800R",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2800R",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2800S"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6005Q",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2800S",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2800S",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**FalkorDB** and **Neo4j Community** offer property graph engines with sub-millisecond Cypher querying.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6005R",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2800T",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2800T",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2800V"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX68000",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2800V",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2800V",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**SQLite** and **DuckDB** with DuckPGQ offer local-first, lightweight deployments.",
    "title": "00C64YWX68001",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2800W",
