    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX68004",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2800Z",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2800Z",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28010"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX68005",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28010",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28010",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**SolidJS** (chosen UI framework) provides fine-grained signal-based reactivity without Virtual DOM overhead for rendering deep-read outliners and reified inline spans.",
    "title": "00C64YWX68006",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28011",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28011",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28012"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX68007",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28012",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28012",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**React Flow** / **XYFlow** and **Mermaid.js** offer visual graph and diagram rendering utilities.",
    "title": "00C64YWX68008",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28013",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
