  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28017",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28017",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**LangGraph** enables stateful, cyclical multi-agent orchestration to model read–write loops across intake, validation, and impact sweep agents.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6800D",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28018",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28018",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28019"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6800E",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28019",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28019",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**PydanticAI** provides type-safe, schema-guided agent definitions ensuring outputs adhere to exact block-tree entity schemas.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6800F",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2801A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2801A",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2801B",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2801C"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6800G",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2801B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2801B",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Interoperability, procedures, and boundary validation",
    "title": "00C64YWX6800H",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2801C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2801C",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2801D",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2801F",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2801H"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX6800J",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2801D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2801D",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2801E"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6800K",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2801E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2801E",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**Agent Skills** (`SKILL.md`) serves as an open standard for defining modular, loadable agent instructions and view templates.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6800M",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2801F",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2801F",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2801G"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6800N",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2801G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2801G",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**TypeBox** / **Zod** (TypeScript) and **Pydantic** (Python) serve as boundary transducers enforcing schema contracts at network edges.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6800P",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2801H",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2801H",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2801J"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6800Q",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2801J",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2801J",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Direct Service APIs (GraphQL or REST) serve as direct communication interfaces between agents and backend services.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6800R",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2801K",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
