  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2803Q",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2803Q",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Fine-grained signal reactivity without Virtual DOM overhead",
    "title": "00C64YWX68032",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2803R",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2803R",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2803S",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2803V",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2803X"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX68033",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2803S",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2803S",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2803T"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX68034",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2803T",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2803T",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Compiles template JSX into direct DOM mutations without virtual DOM reconciliation cascades.",
    "title": "00C64YWX68035",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2803V",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2803V",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2803W"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX68036",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2803W",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2803W",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Updating an inline `<span>`, reified node badge, or discourse trail tag updates only the exact target DOM element with near-zero CPU footprint.",
    "title": "00C64YWX68037",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2803X",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2803X",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2803Y"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX68038",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2803Y",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2803Y",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Prevents micro-stutters and re-rendering cascades across massive, deeply nested outliner trees.",
    "title": "00C64YWX68039",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2803Z",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2803Z",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28040",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28041"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6803A",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28040",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28040",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Optimization for agentic deep-read views",
    "title": "00C64YWX6803B",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28041",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28041",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28042",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28044"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX6803C",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28042",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28042",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28043"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6803D",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28043",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28043",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Since AI agents execute structural graph edits via backend transducers, the UI functions primarily as a high-performance **deep-read projection layer** with light human annotation.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6803E",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28044",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28044",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28045"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6803F",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28045",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28045",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Signals subscribe directly to background streaming deltas, updating rendered views surgically as agents commit updates.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6803G",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28046",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28046",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28047",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28048"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6803H",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28047",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28047",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Relativistic context ergonomics",
    "title": "00C64YWX6803J",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28048",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28048",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28049"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX6803K",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28049",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28049",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804A"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6803M",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804A",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Solid primitives (`createSignal`, `createContext`, `createStore`) map naturally to relativistic node scoping, allowing child nodes and inline spans to bind locally without triggering parent component re-evaluations.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6803N",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804B",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804C",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804D"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6803P",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804C",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Preservation of manual skills & zero-background-API sub-agent execution rationale",
    "title": "00C64YWX6803Q",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804D",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804E",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804Q",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28050"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX6803R",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804E",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804F",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804G"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6803S",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804F",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804F",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Background constraint: Coding-agent-only environment",
    "title": "00C64YWX6803T",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804G",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804H",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804K",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804N"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX6803V",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804H",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804H",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804J"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6803W",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804J",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804J",
    "children": [],
    "text": "In enterprise or research lab environments, developers are provided access exclusively to primary coding agents (e.g., Claude Code, Antigravity) via local harnesses, while secondary external LLM API keys are strictly blocked or restricted.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6803X",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804K",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804K",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804M"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6803Y",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804M",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804M",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Traditional agentic memory frameworks (such as Letta/MemGPT, Mem0, or Zep) rely on background API servers running continuous summarization and vector indexing loops, making them unusable under zero-API constraints.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6803Z",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804N",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804N",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804P"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX68040",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804P",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804P",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Basic model-less agent wikis provide local file reading, but lack structured multi-faceted node semantics (Article, Source, Talk, History), on-demand reification, and dependency tracking.",
    "title": "00C64YWX68041",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804Q",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804Q",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804R",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804S"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX68042",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804R",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804R",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Solution: Local sub-agent spawning via standard `SKILL.md` contracts",
    "title": "00C64YWX68043",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804S",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804S",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804T",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804W",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804Y"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX68044",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804T",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804T",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804V"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX68045",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804V",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804V",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Aperas retains the lightweight procedural skill set (`SKILL.md`) in Phase 3 rather than forcing background API dependencies.",
    "title": "00C64YWX68046",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804W",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804W",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804X"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX68047",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804X",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804X",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Primary coding agents leverage native CLI primitives (headless process execution like `claude -p`), internal sub-agent tools, or direct local execution scripts to spawn isolated local child agents.",
    "title": "00C64YWX68048",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804Y",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804Y",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804Z"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX68049",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2804Z",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2804Z",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Child sub-agents execute focused graph operations (AST parsing, WOQL traversals, span reification, Talk ledger updates) using the developer's existing authorized agent harness without incurring secondary API costs.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6804A",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28050",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28050",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28051",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28052"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6804B",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28051",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28051",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Cognitive shift: Intelligence in data topology and transducers",
    "title": "00C64YWX6804C",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28052",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28052",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28053"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX6804D",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28053",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28053",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28054"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6804E",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28054",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28054",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Advanced agentic memory is achieved through deterministic TerminusDB schemas, Unified.js transducers, and structured `SKILL.md` instructions rather than perpetual background LLM calls.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6804F",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28055",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28055",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28056",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28057"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6804G",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28056",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28056",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Boundary validation & schema generation rationale",
    "title": "00C64YWX6804H",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28057",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28057",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28058",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2805A"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX6804J",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28058",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28058",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28059"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6804K",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA28059",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA28059",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Selection: TypeBox / Zod (TypeScript) & Pydantic (Python)",
    "title": "00C64YWX6804M",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2805A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2805A",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2805B",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2805C"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6804N",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2805B",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2805B",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Role as perimeter transducers",
    "title": "00C64YWX6804P",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2805C",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2805C",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2805D",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2805F"
    ],
    "ordered": false,
    "start": 1,
    "title": "00C64YWX6804Q",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2805D",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2805D",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2805E"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6804R",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2805E",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2805E",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Enforces strict schema contracts exclusively at external API, LLM tool-calling, and DB mutation boundaries.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6804S",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2805F",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2805F",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2805G"
    ],
    "title": "00C64YWX6804T",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2805G",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2805G",
    "children": [],
    "text": "Keeps the core graph substrate fluid and unconstrained while guaranteeing type safety when communicating with deterministic runtimes.",
    "title": "00C64YWX6804V",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2805H",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAA2805H",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAA2805J",
