    "text": "Automated tracking trigger (`AperasKG/.githooks/post-commit`, `post-index-change`) — done: `post-commit` auto-runs a scoped `kg:track` on commit, `post-index-change` auto-runs a full `kg:track` sweep on branch checkout / `git reset` (including `--hard`, which fires no hook of its own) — `post-checkout` was tried too but dropped as redundant once `post-index-change` was confirmed to fire alongside it with equivalent coverage.",
