    "text": "KG backup/restore — `restore.sh`/`tdb-log.sh`/`tdb-doc.sh` relocated to `Aperas/scripts/` and re-scoped as Core-Engine infra (documented in `Aperas-architecture.md` §1/§7), not domain-KG-specific — `db/` itself is gone from `AperasKG/`. `tdb-cross-diff.sh` was *not* migrated with them (its own hash-gated rewrite was already pending the ID-identity fix); genuinely gone, not relocated.",
