    "blockId": "00C5FPAHF001B",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**Projection Engines (Phase 1)**: SolidJS read-projection wiring to TerminusDB AST nodes, including the 'Hover Preview' link mechanism and Artifact generation respecting the `unfolded` view-state.",
