    ],
    "title": "## Stage 2: Ingestion & AST Parser Refactoring",
    "type": "heading",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ800Y",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAMJ800Y",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**Target File**: `web/src/lib/astParser.ts` and `web/src/lib/artifacts.ts`",
    "title": "00C5FPAMJ800Y",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ800Z",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAMJ800Z",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8010",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8012",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8014",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8016",
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8018"
    ],
    "title": "00C5FPAMJ800Z",
    "type": "list",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8010",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAMJ8010",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8011"
    ],
    "title": "00C5FPAMJ8010",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8011",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAMJ8011",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**Directory Traversal & Folder Ingestion**: Refactor `artifacts.ts` to ingest folder structures as `FolderNode`s. If a `README.md` exists in a folder, its content is fully ingested into the `FolderNode` (extracting the abstract into `text` and prepending its parsed children to the folder's `children`). Do not expose `README.md` as a separate `ArtifactNode`.",
    "title": "00C5FPAMJ8011",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8012",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAMJ8012",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8013"
    ],
    "title": "00C5FPAMJ8012",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8013",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAMJ8013",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**Fractal Tree Generation**: Refactor the markdown transducer to output an infinitely nested tree of `BlockNode`s rather than a flat, positional list.",
    "title": "00C5FPAMJ8013",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8014",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAMJ8014",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8015"
    ],
    "title": "00C5FPAMJ8014",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8015",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAMJ8015",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**Content-Addressed IDs**: Replace positional ID generation (`doc1_block1`) with deterministic content hashing (combining parent context and block content).",
    "title": "00C5FPAMJ8015",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8016",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAMJ8016",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8017"
    ],
    "title": "00C5FPAMJ8016",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8017",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAMJ8017",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**Link Extraction**: Modify the parser to extract inline Markdown links and properties, storing them structurally as `BaseLink` objects in the `BlockNode.links` array.",
    "title": "00C5FPAMJ8017",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8018",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAMJ8018",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8019"
    ],
    "title": "00C5FPAMJ8018",
    "type": "listItem",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ8019",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAMJ8019",
    "children": [],
    "text": "**Title vs. Text Split**: Implement the ingestion logic for `title` vs `text`. (For headings: title is heading text, text is body. For normal blocks: fallback to first line or ID until the AI summarization agent is integrated).",
    "title": "00C5FPAMJ8019",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "unfolded": false
  },
  {
    "@id": "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ801A",
    "@type": "BlockNode",
    "blockId": "00C5FPAMJ801A",
    "children": [
      "BlockNode/00C5FPAMJ801B"
    ],
